n V, when in reality the southernmost tip of V is a 150 kilometers to the southeast. ID V, W, X, Y, Z.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T18:35:02Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Cape of good hope", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T18:35:03Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Cape", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T18:35:08Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Good hope", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T18:35:09Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Cape of good hope", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T18:35:16Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Africa", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T18:35:20Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Africa", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T18:35:20Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Cape horn", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T18:35:46Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "W is left", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T18:35:47Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Netherlands?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T18:36:05Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Bartolomeu Dias was from which country?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T18:36:08Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "W is Portugal?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T18:36:08Z",